OUT OF SCOPE (do not build): hash chains or signatures · accounts/login · AI or
plagiarism detection of any kind · keystroke capture · screen capture of any kind
(getDisplayMedia) — NEVER · photo attachments — not in this build · multi-user editing ·
comments or grading · student directory/feed · automatic deletion (stated as a limit) ·
server export route (export is client-side).

